menu "RouteLoom bench node"

config ROUTELOOM_BENCH_CONTROLLER
    hex "Bench controller Node ID; 0 = first route gateway"
    default 0x0
    help
        Management commands (FAULT_SET, COUNTER_RESET, RESET_REQUEST,
        PEER_SEND_START) are accepted only from this origin. 0 binds the
        controller to the first route gateway once the scoped uplink
        installs. Not a production identity claim — dev bench only.

endmenu
